=== A. sign structure ===
V0 = +1: V0[1+cos x] has min 0, max 2 over one period
V0 = -1: V0[1+cos x] has min -2, max 0 over one period
fraction of period with V0[1+cos x] < 0 (V0=+1): 0.0
fraction of period with V0[1+cos x] > 0 (V0=-1): 0.0
fraction of period with bare V0 cos x < 0 (V0=+1): 0.5
hilltop quadratic expansion of 1+cos x about x=0: 2 - x**2/2 ; zero at x = [2] ; true minimum of 1+cos x at x = pi = 3.141592653589793 with value 0
toy note tau-type potential -2mu(1+cos 2phi) at mu=1: min -4 max 0
general V0[c + cos x], V0 > 0: minimum = V0*(c - 1) -> negative somewhere iff c < 1; the written form has c = 1

